 is not part of the unrestricted open-license starter set.","limitations","guidance","list","Setup","ordered",true,"items",[73,74,75],"setup","Review the intended use against the listing and applicable Epic terms before selecting Lyra as an AI data fixture.","Acquire the sample through Epic/Fab and create a project compatible with the selected Unreal Engine version.","Pin the engine, plugins, map and match configuration; use a small local task before multiplayer tests.","Try these tasks",false,[80,81,82],"testTasks","Modify a small ability or input behavior and validate it in a bounded match.","Change a game-feature plugin and verify activation, character setup and multiplayer behavior.","Test a permitted character animation/import task and inspect skeleton mapping and runtime playback.","AI use and evaluation boundary","The Fab AI field requires a separate check for the intended asset/data workflow. It should not be expanded into a claim that every coding assistant edit is prohibited, or ignored as blanket permission for AI evaluation or training.","aiUseNote","links","Supporting evidence",[90,91,92],"evidence",{"_54":97,"_25":98},{"_54":95,"_25":96},{"_54":93,"_25":94},"Unreal Engine EULA","https://www.unrealengine.com/en-US/eula/unreal","Fab access and content fields","https://www.fab.com/listings/93faede1-4434-47c0-85f1-bf27c0820ad0?lang=en","Official Lyra documentation","https://dev.epicgames.com/documentation/en-us/unreal-engine/lyra-sample-game-in-unreal-engine","Read the terms",[102],"licenseUrl",{"_54":99,"_25":96},"Terms category","Engine-specific terms","terms","provenance","Asset license","UE-Only content under applicable Epic terms. The reviewed Fab listing displays Allows usage with AI: No.","assetLicense","Code license","Unreal Engine sample and engine terms; source-included does not mean an OSI open-source license.","codeLicense","Get started",[116],"access",{"_54":117,"_25":96,"_118":119},"Get free Lyra sample","note","Free source-included sample th